From 5aaead9af015f8311ee683ea9b6d9990b64da1bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ignaciopd3 <210892957+ignaciopd3@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 23:08:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 17/24] date_on_top, and Casa's temperature and humidity on the
 clock screens

date_on_top: the date takes the greeting's line, so the weather beside the clock
shows the whole sky on one line and the feels-like and next days on the second,
where it used to cut "Parcialmente nublado" and drop the feels-like; the ADB
warning shortens to a badge at the end of the date's line.

ClockCasa (casa_row): on ClockActivity and the ClockDream screensaver, the
weather goes under "Outside" and Casa's living-room temperature and humidity sit
beside it under "Home"; without a reading from Casa the clock looks as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
